==Strategy==
[[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], meatshielding, and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] do very well here. Do your best to kill the Chibinel, because with two Chibinels stacked up maintaining a strong defense line gets very hard quickly. Long Distance units like [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Awakened Mina]] or an Uber can snipe Chibinel and remove tons of health from it. If you have [[Catway (Super Rare Cat)|Time Traveller Cat]], he does great here, having high stackability and dealing high damage against both Chibinel and the Dark enemies. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] can kill the first Chibinel and damage Darkjo.

